@startuml
title 轉帳處理－依 TransferService.transfer() 實際實作
autonumber
actor "登入使用者" as User
participant "TransferController" as C
participant "TransferService" as S
participant "AccountRepository" as R
participant "WithdrawalService" as W
participant "DepositService" as D
database "MySQL（同一資料庫交易）" as DB
User -> C : POST /api/transfers
C -> S : transfer(TransferRequest)
note right of S : 檢查 requestKey、帳戶、金額與兩帳戶不同
@Transactional(READ_COMMITTED, rollbackFor=Exception)
S -> R : findByIdForUpdate(較小帳戶ID)
R -> DB : SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
S -> R : findByIdForUpdate(較大帳戶ID)
R -> DB : SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
S -> W : withdraw(衍生的 TR-OUT-* 請求)
W -> DB : 更新轉出餘額、交易及異動紀錄
S -> D : deposit(衍生的 TR-IN-* 請求)
D -> DB : 更新轉入餘額、交易及異動紀錄
S --> C : TransferResponse(SUCCESS)
C --> User : HTTP 200
note bottom of S : 任一必要步驟失敗會透過交易管理器回滾；
轉出與轉入共用同一個交易邊界。
@enduml
